# Backup, merge-leftover, and editor scratch copies. A .bak of a page is a second
# verbatim copy of it — and because this project is served as static files from the
# repo root, a committed backup is a live URL. Paired with the same patterns in
# .vercelignore: this rule stops the commit, that one stops the deploy.
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*~
*.swp

# Local Supabase CLI state, if the CLI is ever linked to this project.
supabase/.temp/
